  "keyFeatures": [
    "Run WordPress entirely in the browser via WebAssembly (no server required)",
    "Blueprints: declarative JSON configs to define WordPress site states and steps",
    "JavaScript API (startPlaygroundWeb) for embedding Playground in iframes",
    "Query API for controlling Playground via URL parameters",
    "CLI tool (@wp-playground/cli) for zero-setup local WordPress development",
    "Support for multiple PHP versions (7.4–8.5) compiled to WASM",
    "SQLite integration (no MySQL required)",
    "Offline support via service workers",
    "Node.js runtime support (@php-wasm/node) alongside browser runtime",
